Description: ARIB MPEG-TS utilities for mirakc
 Tools to scan services, collect EITs, and filter ARIB TS
 streams. Binary is /var/jb/usr/bin/mirakc-arib. Cross-built
 on Mac with tsduck-arib and aribb24 linked in. Not in
 Procursus. Does not include mirakc itself.
